Package: manimR
Title: A Grammar of Mathematical Animation for R
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gio", "Author", email = "geofmanda@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("manimR contributors", role = "ctb")
  )
Author: Gio Author [aut, cre, cph]
Maintainer: Gio Author <geofmanda@gmail.com>
Description: Create mathematical animations using a tidyverse-friendly grammar of
    motion. Inspired by Grant Sanderson's 'manim' library, manimR makes it as easy
    to create stunning mathematical visualizations as it is to create plots with
    'ggplot2'. Features include LaTeX integration, data-driven animations,
    ggplot2 conversion, and a visual scene builder RStudio addin.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
